---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "fn main():\n    var x = 1\n    let y = mut x\n"
---
error[TDS0115]: `mut` can only mark a call argument
  ┌─ TDS0115-misplaced-mode.tds:3:13
  │
3 │     let y = mut x
  │             ^^^ not allowed here
  │
  = note: write `mut` in a call to lend a variable for changing: `f(mut x)`
  = help: to declare a variable that can change, use `var`
